<p>Fire off a quick sling bullet for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">93%, 115%, 132%, 147%, 160%</acronym> damage at double your normal attack speed, as well as increasing your attack speed by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">12%, 19%, 22%, 25%, 27%</acronym> for 5 turns.</p><p>Each time you move, the cooldown of this talent is reduced by 1.</p>